    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotions unfold in shaved ice, a journey of self-discovery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yume Kakigori is a unique visual novel featuring Japanese shaved ice and customer interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a shaved ice shop owner who has lost their ability to speak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Raven, you will express yourself through shaved ice and gradually uncover the truths behind the characters and the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.poster.avif?t=1753929527\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.webm?t=1753929527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.mp4?t=1753929527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>By combining three syrups representing Emotion (Red), Desire (Yellow), and Thought (Blue), players create shaved ice symbolizing various feelings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shaved ice made by the player carries their thoughts and emotions, allowing them to connect with customers and learn more about their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/a199d1f6793c54c913af22a823594f4d.avif?t=1753929527\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these visitors comes with their own unique backstory and hidden clues embedded in the documents you\u2019ll encounter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are invited to explore their stories and piece together the fragments of a mysterious universe. As they explore each customer's story, players will also confront their own emotions, embarking together on a journey of self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Would Your Color Affects their Destiny?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotions unfold in shaved ice, a journey of self-discovery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yume Kakigori is a unique visual novel featuring Japanese shaved ice and customer interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a shaved ice shop owner who has lost their ability to speak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Raven, you will express yourself through shaved ice and gradually uncover the truths behind the characters and the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.poster.avif?t=1753929527\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.webm?t=1753929527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.mp4?t=1753929527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>By combining three syrups representing Emotion (Red), Desire (Yellow), and Thought (Blue), players create shaved ice symbolizing various feelings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shaved ice made by the player carries their thoughts and emotions, allowing them to connect with customers and learn more about their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/a199d1f6793c54c913af22a823594f4d.avif?t=1753929527\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these visitors comes with their own unique backstory and hidden clues embedded in the documents you\u2019ll encounter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are invited to explore their stories and piece together the fragments of a mysterious universe. As they explore each customer's story, players will also confront their own emotions, embarking together on a journey of self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Would Your Color Affects their Destiny?</h2>",
    "short_description": "In a colorless world, you open a shaved ice shop guided by a mysterious raven. Through emotion, you connect with your customers and uncover their past and the world\u2019s hidden truth\u2014Yume Kakigori is a quiet journey through feelings and self-discovery.",
